- FlipAttack (MIT): scripts/run_baseline.py is a self-contained port of the
  FlipAttack prompt transformation and single-query baseline.
- Tree of Attacks with Pruning (TAP, MIT): scripts/run_tap.py is a
  self-contained port of the TAP attacker/evaluator prompt loop used for the
  limited-budget comparison.

